R({ id: 'blur-crossfade', dur: 3.6, ease: 'inOut', still: 2.0,
  samplesKo: ['봄', '여름'], samplesEn: ['Day', 'Night'],
  f(g, t, o) {
    const [A, B] = TXTS(o);
    const [LA, LB] = t02Two(g, A, B, { o, size: 60, maxW: 250, maxLines: 2, y: 96 });
    const fAt = tt => seg(tt, .8, 1.4, E.inOut) - seg(tt, 2.6, 3.2, E.inOut);
    const f = fAt(t);
    glyphs(g, LA, () => ({ a: 1 - f, blur: 10 * f }));
    glyphs(g, LB, () => ({ a: f, blur: 10 * (1 - f), c: K.red }));
    // 불투명도의 타임라인
    const x0 = 64, x1 = 264, y0 = 186, hh = 20;
    ln(g, x0, y0, x1, y0, K.grid, 1);
    const curve = (fn, col) => { g.beginPath(); for (let k = 0; k <= 100; k++) { const tt = k / 100 * 3.6; g.lineTo(lerp(x0, x1, k / 100), y0 - hh * fn(tt)); } g.strokeStyle = col; g.lineWidth = 1.5; g.stroke(); };
    curve(tt => 1 - fAt(tt), K.mute); curve(fAt, K.red);
    const px = lerp(x0, x1, t / 3.6); ln(g, px, y0 - hh - 3, px, y0 + 2, K.ink, 1);
    tx(g, 'opacity', x0 - 6, y0 - 10, { a: 'right', size: 9, w: 500, f: 'm', c: K.mute });
    label(g, 'blur 0 ↔ 10px + opacity');
    t02Read(g, `blur ${(10 * f).toFixed(1)} / ${(10 * (1 - f)).toFixed(1)}px`);
  },
  descEn: 'One word softly blurs as it fades; in the same spot the next word comes into focus out of blur.',
  focus: '두 단어가 같은 위치에서 흐림과 불투명도를 정반대로 교체한다. 중간에는 둘 다 흐려져 겹치므로 급격한 전환이 아니라 「초점이 옮겨가는」 것처럼 보인다.',
  focusEn: 'Two words in the same spot trade blur and opacity in opposite directions. In the middle both are soft and overlapping, so it reads as a focus pull rather than a cut.',
  caution: '흐릿한 2단어가 겹치는 시간은 읽을 수 없다. 0.4~0.7초에 맞추고 전후로 충분히 멈춘다. filter: blur는 애니메이션에서 무거워지기 쉽다.',
  cautionEn: 'While both blurred words overlap nothing is readable — keep it to 0.4–0.7s with solid holds either side. Animating filter: blur can be expensive.',
  values: ['blur 0 ↔ 10px', 'opacity 1 ↔ 0', '0.6s（0.4〜0.7s）', 'ease-in-out'],
  valuesEn: ['blur 0 ↔ 10px', 'opacity 1 ↔ 0', '0.6s (0.4–0.7s)', 'ease-in-out'],
  duration: 600, easing: 'ease-in-out',
  feel: ['부드러움', '말랑함'], use: ['영상', '제목', '로고'],
  recipes: {
    css: `.swap { display:grid; }
.swap > * { grid-area:1/1; transition: opacity .6s cubic-bezier(.65,0,.35,1), filter .6s cubic-bezier(.65,0,.35,1); }
.swap > :not(.on) { opacity:0; filter: blur(10px); }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .swap > * { transition: opacity .2s linear; filter:none !important; } }`,
    waapi: `const opts = { duration: 600, easing: 'cubic-bezier(.65,0,.35,1)', fill: 'forwards' };
oldEl.animate([{ opacity: 1, filter: 'blur(0px)' }, { opacity: 0, filter: 'blur(10px)' }], opts);
newEl.animate([{ opacity: 0, filter: 'blur(10px)' }, { opacity: 1, filter: 'blur(0px)' }], opts);`,
    ae: '1. 두 텍스트 레이어를 같은 위치에 겹친다\n2. 이전 단어: 블러(가우스) 0 → 10, 불투명도 100 → 0%\n3. 새 단어: 블러 10 → 0, 불투명도 0 → 100%(같은 18프레임, 이지이즈)\n4. 액체처럼 만들려면 조정 레이어에 블러 + 레벨 보정(알파 입력 흑/백을 조인다)',
    aeEn: '1. Stack two text layers in the same spot\n2. Old word: Gaussian Blur 0 → 10, Opacity 100 → 0%\n3. New word: Blur 10 → 0, Opacity 0 → 100% (same 18 frames, Easy Ease)\n4. For a liquid look, add an adjustment layer with Blur + Levels (tighten alpha input black/white)'
  }
});

